### PUT /<index_name> (Nori Analyzer Configuration)

Source: https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/blob/main/docs/reference/elasticsearch-plugins/analysis-nori-tokenizer.md

Creates or updates an Elasticsearch index with custom analysis settings to incorporate the Nori tokenizer. This allows for Korean text processing in mapped fields.

```APIDOC
## PUT /<index_name>

### Description
Creates or updates an Elasticsearch index with custom analysis settings to incorporate the Nori tokenizer for Korean text processing. This endpoint is used to define a custom analyzer that leverages the Nori plugin.

### Method
PUT

### Endpoint
PUT /<index_name>

### Parameters
#### Path Parameters
- **index_name** (string) - Required - The name of the index to create or update.

#### Request Body
- **settings.analysis.tokenizer.<tokenizer_name>.type** (string) - Required - Must be "nori_tokenizer".
- **settings.analysis.tokenizer.<tokenizer_name>.decompound_mode** (string) - Optional - Sets the decompound mode for compound words. Options: `discard`, `none`, `mixed`. Default is `discard`.
- **settings.analysis.tokenizer.<tokenizer_name>.user_dictionary** (string) - Optional - Path to a custom user dictionary file relative to the config directory.
- **settings.analysis.analyzer.<analyzer_name>.type** (string) - Required - Must be "custom".
- **settings.analysis.analyzer.<analyzer_name>.tokenizer** (string) - Required - The name of the tokenizer to use (e.g., "nori_tokenizer").
- **settings.analysis.analyzer.<analyzer_name>.filter** (array of strings) - Optional - An array of token filters to apply after tokenization.
- **mappings.properties.<field_name>.type** (string) - Required - The type of the field, e.g., "text".
- **mappings.properties.<field_name>.analyzer** (string) - Required - The name of the analyzer to use for this field (e.g., "nori_analyzer").

### Request Example
```json
{
  "settings": {
    "analysis": {
      "tokenizer": {
        "my_nori_tokenizer": {
          "type": "nori_tokenizer",
          "decompound_mode": "mixed"
        }
      },
      "analyzer": {
        "my_nori_analyzer": {
          "type": "custom",
          "tokenizer": "my_nori_tokenizer",
          "filter": ["lowercase"]
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "mappings": {
    "properties": {
      "korean_text": {
        "type": "text",
        "analyzer": "my_nori_analyzer"
      }
    }
  }
}
```

### Response
#### Success Response (200)
- **acknowledged** (boolean) - Indicates if the request was acknowledged.
- **shards_acknowledged** (boolean) - Indicates if the shards were acknowledged.
- **index** (string) - The name of the created/updated index.

#### Response Example
```json
{
  "acknowledged": true,
  "shards_acknowledged": true,
  "index": "my_nori_index"
}
```
```

